# Copy this file to .env for local testing. .env itself is gitignored —
# never commit real credentials.
#
# As of rev. 2 (hybrid GitHub Actions + Jetson Nano architecture, see
# DECISIONS.md), the scraping/sync pipeline needs ZERO secrets:
#   - Cloud spiders (1PC, Plonter, later Ivory) hit public endpoints only.
#   - The Nano authenticates to GitHub with a repo-scoped SSH deploy key
#     on its own filesystem (nano/README.md) — not an env var, not here.
#
# The one optional value below is for error alerting (§9 of the plan),
# not yet wired into the code — leave blank until that's built.

SENTRY_DSN=
